##! experimental.givens
import { orders } from '../orders.malloy'
import { BRAND } from '../givens.malloy'

// The drill target: `# drill { to=["overview"] }` needs a real dashboard to
// resolve to, and this one serves.
//
// It also carries the single-query form's own mistake, which no other file here
// makes. `dashboard_columns` is read for the grid on a COMPOSITE only, and with
// no `# dashboard` tag the renderer has no grid to lay out, so this renders as
// one nested table. Its other finding is BRAND's suggest, which names a query
// nothing defines.
# artifact { title="Overview" dashboard_columns=6 }
query: overview is orders -> {
   where: brand_name ~ $BRAND
   group_by: brand_name
   aggregate: total_amount
}
